 늪 숲은 여전히 몬스터가 출몰하는 위험한 곳이라 사냥에는 적합하지 않지요.","source_cn":"我看到有猎人闯入了<style=highlight>黑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB0170CE20A5460F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322247002:1":{"text":"그를 구하고 검은 늪 숲은 위험하니 들어가지 말라고 전해주실 수 있나요?","source_cn":"我想拜托你将他营救出来，告诉他黑沼森林现在很危险，不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FA293EF323C71BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222480.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222480","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222480","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322248001:0":{"text":"저기 사냥꾼이 검은 늪 숲으로 들어가고 있어요!","source_cn":"看，那里有个猎人走进了黑沼森林！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4919F7445FB81E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322248002:0":{"text":"너무 위험해요! 어서 그를 막으러 가요!","source_cn":"太危险了！我们快去追他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4274A4E727C08611","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222490.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222490","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222490","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322249001:0":{"text":"사냥꾼이 몬스터에게 포위되었어요. 어서 그를 구하러 가요!","source_cn":"那个猎人被魔物包围了，我们快去救他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x183C4FE4AB4F3136","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222500.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222500","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222500","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322250001:1":{"text":"사냥꾼씨! 검은 늪 숲은 위험해요. 다시는 사냥하러 들어오지 마세요!","source_cn":"猎人先生，黑沼森林十分危险，请不要再闯进这里打猎了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x203EC3FD715381D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322250002:1":{"text":"저는... 이곳 사냥감이 더 돈이 될 거라고 생각해서... 그런데 이렇게 몬스터가 많을 줄이야...","source_cn":"我……我只是觉得这边的猎物可能会比较值钱……没想到这么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E62A37F8019632C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322250003:1":{"text":"여기는 몬스터가 점령한 곳이라 사냥하기에는 좋지 않아요. 저희가 안전하게 데려다 드릴게요.","source_cn":"这里被魔物占据，不适合打猎，我们送你出去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40107FE67FF05CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322250004:1":{"text":"가, 감사해요... 다시는 들어오지 않을게요.","source_cn":"谢…谢谢……我不会再来这里了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x939AE605A16CFEB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:闯入森林的猎人":{"text":"숲에 침입한 사냥꾼","source":"闯入森林的猎人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222510.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222510","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222510","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322251001:0":{"text":"엄청 큰 몬스터예요! 여기서 계속 우리가 나오기를 기다리고 있던 걸까요?","source_cn":"好大的魔物！它是一直蹲守在这里等我们出来吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD38B86DE1E26CF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322251002:0":{"text":"어서 처치하고 사냥꾼을 안전한 곳으로 데려가요.","source_cn":"快速解决它，好把猎人送到安全的地方吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8010AF929DEA5EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222520.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222520","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222520","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322252001:0":{"text":"몬스터를 처치했으니 어서 시더 마을로 돌아가요!","source_cn":"魔物被打败了，我们这就回雪松镇吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3039DE74A622AE5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222530.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222530","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222530","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322253001:1":{"text":"앞으로는 위험한 검은 늪 숲에 함부로 들어가면 안 돼요!","source_cn":"以后可不要再闯入危险的黑沼森林了噢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98D14C9FE1C0BE4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322253002:0":{"text":"네, 앞으로는 안전한 동쪽 숲으로 갈게요. 고마워요.","source_cn":"好的，我以后还是去安全的东边树林吧，谢谢你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA515A81B2E06F2A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:到家的猎人":{"text":"집에 도착한 사냥꾼","source":"到家的猎人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}}}}